<title>UK: Bladex sets $75 million June 2001 FRN.</title>
<headline>Bladex sets $75 million June 2001 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO LATINOAMERICANO DE EXPORTACIONES SA</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    04.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     50 BP     PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA2	ISS PRICE  99.825    FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB	 REOFFER    99.825</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		*US/UK/PANAMA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
